# 第八百六十四部　法向 Jet 是隐藏观察者纤维的偶矩

令

$$
\phi_\xi(u)
=
\frac12\Phi_\xi(|u|),
\qquad
u\in\mathbb R.
$$

于是

$$
\boxed{
F(z)
=
\int_{\mathbb R}
\phi_\xi(x)e^{zx}\,dx.
}
\tag{864.1}
$$

代入式 (863.2)：

$$
\begin{aligned}
R(\delta,t)
=
\iint_{\mathbb R^2}
\phi_\xi(x)\phi_\xi(y)
e^{it(x+y)}
e^{\delta(x-y)}
\,dx\,dy.
\end{aligned}
\tag{864.2}
$$

由于交换 \(x,y\) 不改变积分，指数项可以对称化为：

$$
e^{\delta(x-y)}
\longmapsto
\cosh\!\bigl(\delta(x-y)\bigr).
